        "summary": "Create new generated secret (internal)",
        "description": "Create a new secret with a randomly generated 256-bit key as payload,\\\n\\\nso the payload never has to be transferred to the server.\\\n\\\nThe secret is owned by the resource \\`resource_uuid\\` of the kind \\`owned_by\\`. Secrets with\\\n\\`owned_by = \"backup\"\\` encrypt the disks within a backup. They don't count to the quota of the\\\nproject and don't block the deletion of the project, because a backup can outlive its project. Like\\\nall secrets, which are owned by a resource, they can't be deleted by the users.",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SecretGenerateInternalReq"
